# --- Keep map data OUT of the repo ---
# All map images and datasets must load live from NASA.
# These rules stop them from being committed by mistake.
# (If you really need an image, e.g. a logo, add an exception like: !logo.png)
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.tif
*.tiff
*.img
*.geojson
*.zip
